# UI/UX Governance

**Contracts:** `UI-CONTRACT.md`, `PLATFORM-CONTRACT.md`  
**Stack rules:** `react-inertia.mdc`

## Component-First

```text
Page → Layout → Toolbar → Form/Grid → Dialog → Actions
```

Search existing components before creating new ones.

## Required UI States

Every async UI: `idle`, `loading`, `success`, `empty`, `error`, `disabled`, `retry`.

## Design System

```text
CSS variables (--sis-*) → Tailwind → shared components → pages
```

No random colors/spacing. Tailwind is styling tool — not architecture.

## Forms

- Inertia `useForm` for mutations
- Client validation = UX; server = authoritative
- Labels, focus, keyboard, touch targets (min ~44px mobile)

## Grids

Server pagination always. Mobile: cards/stack — not forced desktop tables.

## Accessibility

Keyboard nav, focus management, semantic HTML, ARIA where needed, contrast.

## RTL

Arabic RTL first-class — see `react-inertia.mdc`. No hacky global `transform: scaleX(-1)`.

## No Business Logic in UI

Authorization checks in UI are **indicators only**. Never duplicate enrollment/eligibility/tenant rules in React.
